This POC shall implement the first integration of the Saxo trading platform into the Wealth web app.

Specification
Additional menu option labeled "DigitalEdge" is displayed if delivered from Menu endpoint (can be simulated) below menu option "Trading desk"
Click on menu option opens new tab
Upon opening the tab, it should check the DigitalEdge login status.
If the user is not logged in, then
A call to the backend needs to be triggered to get the SAML message used for authentication towards DigitalEdge
The DigitalEdge URL needs to be setup in the new tab
A "POST" must be triggered with the body containing the previously received SAML message as a standard HTML form submit with one parameter named SAMLResponse
Triggering the request should launch the login process at DigitalEdge
From then on the user can interact with DigitalEdge
If the user logged in before
Re-open the tab again and let user continue where he left
The user can switch back to Wealth anytime by switching the tabs
Technical considerations
Probably it makes sense to create a separate mobile-module for this
Dependencies - try to mock for the moment
URL to test DigitalEdge platform
Backend endpoint to retrieve SAML message
Extension of menu structure delivered from backend
Other topics to be tackled outside of this POC
Logout federation
Potential session timeouts
